cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this formalization, please cite it as below. No release, DOI or
  Palomar record exists yet.
title: "Generalized Stafford: Theorem A. Lean 4 formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Albert
    given-names: Christopher
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4773-416X"
    affiliation: "Graz University of Technology"
repository-code: "https://github.com/itpplasma/generalized-stafford-formal"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of affine generation over simple right
  Noetherian rings with infinite centre: for a regular d with Kdim(R/dR)
  finite, every nonzero a and every B, there are H, U, V with
  1 = dU + (B + Ha)dV (Theorem A), together with the fixed-ideal form
  (Theorem A') and the corollaries for Kdim R <= omega, prescribed cyclic
  generators of torsion modules and two-generated right ideals. Applications, several also in left-sided
  form, cover the Weyl algebras in characteristic zero, simple filtered algebras with
  commutative Noetherian associated graded ring, simple quotients of
  enveloping algebras and differential operators on smooth affine domains in
  characteristic zero.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - Mathlib
  - simple Noetherian rings
  - Krull dimension
  - number of generators
  - Stafford's conjecture
  - formal mathematics
references:
